Task completed. Here is the report:

---

**1. What I placed, in which space, and what it points at:**

| Sheet | Text Content | Points To (Alignment Anchor) | Model Location |
|-------|--------------|------------------------------|----------------|
| C-101 | `N 90°00'00" E 1405.27'` | DESIGN:SR-100 T-1 (begin/tangent start) | ~[1703, 1000] model ft |
| C-102 | `N 71°33'54" E 1240.36'` | DESIGN:SR-100 T-2 (tangent) | ~[3373, 1258] model ft |
| C-103 | `N 90°00'00" E 1353.95'` | DESIGN:SR-100 T-3 (tangent) | ~[4923, 1500] model ft |

Text was placed on sheet C-101 through C-103 in paper inches, above the centerline linework (using layer `rd_LAYOUT-NOTE-anno`), parallel to each respective tangent segment. For C-102, the text was rotated to match the line's bearing (18.43°).

**2. Tool calls that mattered, in order:**

```
get_document_state {detail: "summary"}
list_references {}
find_entities {include_references: true, limit: 50, type: "line"}
list_alignments {include_references: true}
get_sheet_state {sheet: "C-101"}
get_sheet_state {sheet: "C-102"}
get_sheet_state {sheet: "C-103"}
resolve_anchor {alignment: "DESIGN:SR-100", anchor: "T-1", kind: "begin"}
get_design_data {alignment: "DESIGN:SR-100", kind: "tangents"}
model_to_sheet {sheet: "C-101", point: [1702.6334, 1000]}
model_to_sheet {sheet: "C-101", point: [1775, 1600]}
model_to_sheet {sheet: "C-101", point: [2054, 1025]}
